{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/ojdjq9","slideIndex":0,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"AI 下一個最大贏家？為什麼我看好博通！","textShapes":1,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ad0329c3","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":28,"width":1480.44,"height":110},"name":"main-title","text":"AI 下一個最大贏家？為什麼我看好博通！","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":60,"typeface":"Noto Sans TC","color":"#0C1B2F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/4zud0ru9","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/ixcvyhw3","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ojdjq9","slideIndex":0,"text":"這波 AI 熱潮，大家最熟悉的贏家是輝達。但 AI 用得愈來愈多，科技公司也得想辦法，把每次運算的成本降下來。Google、OpenAI 這些公司，就在開發適合自己用的 AI 晶片。博通厲害的地方，就是能幫它們把這些晶片做出來。我認為，未來會有更多公司需要這個能力，而博通就能靠它賺更多錢。這就是我看好博通的原因。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/5g7pbc","slideIndex":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 2","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/bmxo3u14","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/cn6pwz2p","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/5g7pbc","slideIndex":1,"text":"博通主要做兩種生意：半導體和企業軟體。第三季的收入裡，半導體大約七成，軟體大約三成。今天要聊的專用 AI 晶片，就在半導體這一塊。這些晶片照客戶的需求設計，也就是客製化晶片。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/kjaj8m","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 3","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/o3ip4f6p","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/3298va5k","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/kjaj8m","slideIndex":2,"text":"博通在這類合作裡，負責幫客戶把設計變成真正的晶片。客戶主導需求和設計，博通幫忙做到能交給工廠製造的階段。這讓科技公司能找外部夥伴，一起開發自己要用的晶片。已經有輝達的產品可以買，這些公司還願意自己做，背後最直接的原因就是成本。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/j900r6","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 4","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/o3i907il","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/3298r2hg","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/j900r6","slideIndex":3,"text":"科技公司想降低的，是 AI 每天運作的成本。使用者每次請 AI 回答問題、整理文章，都會產生運算費用。用的人愈多，晶片和電力的花費也愈大。每次服務就算只省下一點，乘上龐大的使用量，長期下來也會差很多。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/z3ps0m","slideIndex":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 5","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/ofu10zux","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/nel0rutc","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/z3ps0m","slideIndex":4,"text":"客製化晶片的目標，就是用同樣的設備和電力，完成更多運算。公司知道自己的 AI 最常做哪些工作，就能照這些工作調整設計，降低每次服務的成本。每天要處理的工作愈多，這種效率改善帶來的節省就愈可觀。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/r62ovm","slideIndex":5,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 6","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/lknqp4fe","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/yhw7u9w3","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/r62ovm","slideIndex":5,"text":"自己做晶片划不划算，關鍵在使用量夠不夠大。設計晶片、調整軟體，都得先花一筆開發費。後面用得夠多、每次運算省得夠多，才有機會把這筆投入收回來。大型科技公司有龐大的運算需求，也比較有條件投入這門生意。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/izrvzt","slideIndex":6,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 7","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/8zi1o36h","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/7y9kfy5w","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/izrvzt","slideIndex":6,"text":"做 ChatGPT 的 OpenAI，已經找博通合作開發自己的晶片。雙方今年六月公布，從開始設計到把設計交給工廠製造，花了九個月。再看博通整體的 AI 生意，客製化晶片和網路產品已經帶來收入，成長也反映在財報上。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/gx95fh","slideIndex":7,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 8","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/idsri9on","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/5g3ado7y","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gx95fh","slideIndex":7,"text":"AI 已經成為博通收入的主力。截至八月初的第三季，AI 相關營收是 167 億美元，比去年同期增加 221%，變成原來的三倍多。客製化晶片和相關網路產品加起來，占全公司收入大約 56%。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/87cgax","slideIndex":8,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 9","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/tcfypo36","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/694zut4f","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/87cgax","slideIndex":8,"text":"博通全公司的現金流也很強。第三季自由現金流大約 137 億美元，相當於營收的 46%。晶片和軟體兩邊的生意，扣掉設備等投資支出後，留下這筆現金，可以拿來繼續投資、發股利、還債。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/dmr9sj","slideIndex":9,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 10","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/yx4zepgr","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/lkvipkzi","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/dmr9sj","slideIndex":9,"text":"博通預期，下一季 AI 生意還會繼續大幅成長。公司預估第四季 AI 相關營收達到 217 億美元，比第三季多 50 億美元，季增接近三成。前一季已經大幅成長，下一季的收入預估還要再往上加。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/4xtd2n","slideIndex":10,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 11","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/bidwfitw","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/cjmx83a1","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/4xtd2n","slideIndex":10,"text":"博通對未來兩年的 AI 生意，也給出很強的成長預估。2027 財年營收預計達到 1,150 億美元，2028 財年到 2,300 億，等於再翻一倍。這是公司按客戶擴建資料中心的計畫，加上晶片、記憶體的供應進度，估出來的數字。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/wol35a","slideIndex":11,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 12","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/kjet4zex","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/ji5sbuds","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/wol35a","slideIndex":11,"text":"不過博通在客製化晶片上，也有競爭壓力。另一家晶片公司 Marvell，今年七月就和 Google 擴大合作，一起做 AI 運算、連接和儲存相關的客製化產品。大客戶會找不同供應商合作，博通也得爭取下一代產品的生意。除了運算晶片，博通還有網路產品這一塊。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/xg9yhj","slideIndex":12,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 13","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/kjy5k3u5","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/jip4rydk","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/xg9yhj","slideIndex":12,"text":"網路產品讓博通在同一波 AI 投資裡，多了一種賺錢的機會。大量晶片一起運算，資料傳得不夠快，就會拖慢整套設備。客戶增加運算設備，也得升級網路。博通有交換器晶片等產品，除了賺運算晶片的錢，也能賺網路產品的錢。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/rt9lu6","slideIndex":13,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 14","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/3y10rqdg","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/4zahkvu1","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rt9lu6","slideIndex":13,"text":"多代產品的合作，讓博通有機會繼續賺後面的生意。OpenAI 和博通的計畫，已經規劃到好幾代產品。AI 服務更新，晶片和網路也要跟著改，帶出下一代的需求。這是長期成長的機會，而市場也已經對這份成長有了期待。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/e67agf","slideIndex":14,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 15","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/9ozqt8fa","slideIndex":14,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/ml8rytgj","slideIndex":14,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/e67agf","slideIndex":14,"text":"市場對博通的期待，已經放在未來的獲利成長上。分析師預估 2027 財年每股獲利，比 2026 財年增加六成多。前面談的客戶擴建和新產品，都得支撐這個成長幅度。博通現在的預估本益比，用的就是這份獲利估計。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/q11m8o","slideIndex":15,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 16","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/sny9sbmh","slideIndex":15,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/rmpsj6lw","slideIndex":15,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/q11m8o","slideIndex":15,"text":"博通的估值風險，是獲利低於預期。用近期二十個交易日的均價，搭配分析師對 2027 財年的獲利估計，本益比約十八倍。假設最後賺的錢比預期少兩成，同樣的價格就會變成約二十三倍。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/vc0pyu","slideIndex":16,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 17","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/k769g361","slideIndex":16,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/j6x87y5g","slideIndex":16,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/vc0pyu","slideIndex":16,"text":"博通這組估值，沒有明顯比輝達便宜。同樣用近期二十個交易日的均價，搭配輝達 2028 財年的獲利估計，預估本益比約十四倍，低於博通的十八倍。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/1mwe0j","slideIndex":17,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 18","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/z2183qp4","slideIndex":17,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/03a9wvqp","slideIndex":17,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/1mwe0j","slideIndex":17,"text":"博通的風險之一，是收入愈來愈集中在少數大客戶。前五大客戶占第三季全公司收入大約 55%，去年同期大約四成。這幾家公司的投資計畫，對博通的影響愈來愈大。一家大客戶把擴建延後，就會拖到博通原本預期的收入。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/gp6kkr","slideIndex":18,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 19","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/87adg7md","slideIndex":18,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/761cnm5s","slideIndex":18,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gp6kkr","slideIndex":18,"text":"另一個風險，是客戶付不出租金時，博通得按合約補錢。在一筆五年的設備租賃交易裡，金融夥伴先買設備，再租給客戶，博通替租金當保人。設備全部投入使用後，這筆擔保的責任上限約 290 億美元。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/tastnk","slideIndex":19,"layout":{"id":"ly/yx4f6dsr","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 20","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/ih0vupw7","slideIndex":19,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/5krepkfy","slideIndex":19,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":""}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/tastnk","slideIndex":19,"text":"我看好博通未來幾年的獲利成長。AI 收入已經占公司一半以上，全公司也有很強的現金流。客戶擴建時，它能賣晶片，也能賣網路產品；像 OpenAI 的合作，還規劃到好幾代。現在賺得到錢，後面也有持續把生意做大的機會，這讓我把它看成值得長期看好的 AI 成長股。"}